# Corpus-first 工作流

每个机器人科研阶段的第一步固定为：

```text
python scripts/route_robotics_research.py <profile.json> --stage idea|experiment|writing|review
```

该入口硬加载并验证：

1. 100 篇、期刊/会议 1:1、8 轴均匀采样的 `public-paper-index.json`；
2. 八轴语义模型；
3. 无评级字段、带 directness 权重的 v2 venue catalog；
4. 语料校准报告。

随后按项目活动轴返回论文范式、可抽取证据模式、禁止外推边界、研究强度和 venue fit。Idea、Experiment、Writing、Review 都读取同一份 context；venue 官方范围只在语料之后叠加并必须刷新。

---

# English

Every robotics research stage starts with:

```text
python scripts/route_robotics_research.py <profile.json> --stage idea|experiment|writing|review
```

The entry point hard-loads and validates the 100-paper balanced corpus, the eight-axis semantic model, the rating-free v2 venue catalog with directness weights, and the calibration report. It then returns axis-specific paper patterns, evidence obligations, do-not-infer boundaries, research intensity, and venue fit. All four stages consume the same context; current official venue scope is layered on only after the corpus reference is loaded.
